    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜ずつ: each; little by little",
     "texto": [
      "To share something out in equal parts or do something little by little: quantity + **ずつ**: **まいにち ひとつ ずつ、 ことば を おぼえます** (every day I learn one word).",
      "It goes after the number."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜によって: depends on",
     "texto": [
      "To say something varies by person or situation: **ひと に よって、 すき な もの は ちがいます** (what people like differs depending on the person). **によって** can also mark a cause, a means or who performs a passive action; context decides."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
